WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Four rules for every performance check.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.330
Throttle the CPU.

3
00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.450
Record and click.

4
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.000
Find tasks over 50 milliseconds.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.800
Split the work so the page paints first, then record again.

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.170
Then compare with the good values:

7
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:32.800
LCP 2.5 seconds, INP 200 milliseconds, CLS 0.1.
